Task table:
Task | Status | Started | Duration | Progress

Use the actual tasks available for the calculation.

Illustrative tasks:
- Load validated inputs.
- Apply tax rates.
- Calculate sector tax expense.
- Persist calculation results.

Highlight the running task using a light-blue row background and a spinner.

Do not assign the same stage-level progress percentage to every task.
Show task-specific progress only when provided by the backend.

Do not mark all tasks as running unless they are actually running in parallel.

If progress is unavailable:
- Show an indeterminate indicator or “Progress unavailable”.
- Do not invent a percentage.

If timestamps or durations are unavailable:
- Show “Not available” rather than misleading values.

Execution failures:
